sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员从通知 / 搜索 / 外链进入一个列表里还没有的会话，单次关联补齐频道、成员与最新消息窗口，并只在整批持久化成功后看到终态
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: loadChannelIncrement(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channel_load_increment_by_channel_id", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channel_load_increment_by_channel_id", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channel_load_increment_by_channel_id", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 按 channelId 同步补齐单个频道 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/channel/load/incrementByChannelId；条件续拉 POST /api/cses/channel/sync/notify
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction channel/event_seq + sync cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM-->>E: Command Result {data}
  E-->>Gate: PortReply(Result)
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：返回 DialogItem 且拿到即 hydrate（会话集合内不存在则新增，存在则 merge），替代旧 ensure_channel_loaded 与 store:getItem ”channel”；当前频道成员展示快照（members / adminUsers / boss / owner / memberCount）由本 Gate 的返回值提供；它不是 receipt receiver snapshot，不得用于解析 readBits 或恢复历史已读位序；目标首次 Effect 精确为 POST /api/cses/channel/load/incrementByChannelId，JSON body 只能是 ”channelId”: channelId；reqId 由 Helix 生成并仅作为同一 Command/HTTP 关联信息，不得混入 Go body，成功响应 data 必须按 IncrementChannel 解析；频道与 channel_member 先确认持久化；随后仅当 needSync 缺失/为 true，或账号库 durable cursor 小于响应 lastEventSeq 时，条件调用 POST /api/cses/channel/sync/notify，body 精确为 ”cursors”:[”channelId”:channelId,”fromSeq”:durableCursor]；每次续拉的 fromS
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：未命中必须返回 null（graceful），不得抛错；不得因单频道加载失败而中断「打开窗口 / 展示通知 / 生成待办」的主流程（调用方必须 catch）；不得触发 hard-cut 8 项旧链路：imDataSource:* / store:getItem ”channel” / store:query ”channel” / ensure_channel_loaded / imHttp ”/channels/member/byIds” 等，禁止计数恒为 0
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：无业务事件；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
